The VS is configured as L4 SSL, where backend connections map one-to-one to frontend connections, so backend keep-alive cannot be enabled independently in the current setup. It can be achieved either by (a) converting the VS to L7 HTTPS with connection multiplexing, subject to confirming the traffic is HTTP, server keep-alive support, and testing on a parallel VS, or (b) enabling persistent connections on the client side, which the L4 VS will carry through to the backend.
